  "body": "The local model reads `hex40 ok? 1 2f1d0c9b8a7e6f5d4c3b2a1908f7e6d5c4b3a291` as one secret span, `1 2f1d…a291`, and modelFits keeps it: the \"hex run with words after it\" check only looks at the first field, which is `1` here, and hexRe wants 7 or more hex digits.\n\nSo a hash in a tool's output with a count before it is masked, with the model on (rules alone keep it).\n\nRecorded in the masking evaluation as case `hex-lines` (internal/redact/eval_cases_test.go), marked Known with this issue.",
